{"seq":3,"slug":"dimension-space-home","title":"家居尺寸/空间适配筛选","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/vertical-category-search/electronics-home-search/dimension-space-home","wordCount":2522,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"家居尺寸-空间适配筛选\">家居尺寸/空间适配筛选</h1><p>家居品类的搜索问题几乎可以浓缩成一句话：<strong>用户有一个物理空间约束，商品有一个物理尺寸，两者必须相容</strong>。买沙发的人先量了客厅那面墙是 2.4 米；买书桌的人先量了角落的进深是 55 厘米。这些约束不像 3C 的型号那样有明确的枚举值，而是连续数值加上一组常被忽略的安装条件（门宽、电梯尺寸、承重、是否需组装）。这一篇讲家居尺寸检索的完整链路。参数检索的通用方法见 <a href=\"spec-param-query\">3C 规格参数精确检索</a>，结果呈现见 <a href=\"../beauty-fresh-other/vertical-result-ui\">各品类结果页展示差异</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-尺寸参数的多维性\">核心概念：尺寸参数的多维性</h2><p>家居商品的「尺寸」从来不是一个数字，而是至少三个维度加上一组约束条件。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>内容</th>\n<th>检索作用</th>\n<th>常见缺失</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>外形三维</strong></td>\n<td>长 × 宽 × 高（或深）</td>\n<td>空间能否放下（硬约束）</td>\n<td>常只标两项</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>重量与承重</strong></td>\n<td>商品自重、可承载重量</td>\n<td>楼层/地面/使用场景</td>\n<td>承重常缺</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>通行尺寸</strong></td>\n<td>包装尺寸、拆装后最大件尺寸</td>\n<td>能否搬进房间（关键！）</td>\n<td>几乎总是缺失</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>安装条件</strong></td>\n<td>是否需组装、所需工具、预留间隙</td>\n<td>安装可行性</td>\n<td>常缺</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>空间关系</strong></td>\n<td>与周边家具的预留距离（如沙发前需留 60cm 通道）</td>\n<td>场景适配</td>\n<td>无结构化数据</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>「通行尺寸」是家居退货最被低估的原因。</strong> 一件沙发的外形尺寸完全合适，但包装箱宽 1.1 米过不了 0.9 米的门——这个场景在退货原因中占比很高，而绝大多数平台的商品数据里根本没有包装尺寸字段。解决路径有三条：要求商家强制填写包装尺寸（成本高但最有效）、按品类提供默认包装膨胀系数（如沙发包装通常比外形大 15%~25%）、以及在结果页主动提示用户核对门宽与电梯尺寸。第三条是零数据成本且立即有效的做法。</p>\n<p><strong>「预留间隙」是家居品类独有的一类属性。</strong> 餐桌旁要留 75cm 才能拉开椅子，沙发前要留 60cm 才能正常行走，衣柜开门方向要留 50cm 以上。这些不是商品自身的属性，而是「商品 + 使用场景」派生的属性。它们无法从商品数据自动得出，但可以从品类知识库中预置——同一类目下的同类型商品共享同一组间隙规则。这是家居品类最值得投入的领域知识资产。</p>\n<h2 id=\"空间适配的匹配模型\">空间适配的匹配模型</h2><p>把用户的空间约束与商品尺寸做匹配，本质是区间包含问题，但比 3C 的区间匹配多了两个复杂度：<strong>多维度联合约束</strong>与<strong>用户约束的不确定性</strong>。</p>\n<p>多维度联合约束的形式化：用户空间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>u</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>u</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>H</mi><mi>u</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[L_u, W_u, H_u]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 与商品尺寸 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>H</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[L_p, W_p, H_p]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>，匹配成立当且仅当存在一个朝向使得三维均能放下：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∃</mi><mi>π</mi><mo>∈</mo><mtext>Perm</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>:</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>u</mi></msub><mtext> </mtext><mo>∧</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>u</mi></msub><mtext> </mtext><mo>∧</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>H</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>H</mi><mi>u</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\exists \\pi \\in \\text{Perm}(3):\\quad \\pi(L_p) \\le L_u \\ \\wedge\\ \\pi(W_p) \\le W_u \\ \\wedge\\ \\pi(H_p) \\le H_u</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∃</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Perm</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span></span></span></span></span> 是三个维度的排列——因为家具可以旋转摆放，长宽可能互换（但高通常不能，除非允许倒置）。实现上只需检查三种有效排列（长宽互换、长高互换、宽高互换），不必枚举全部六种。<strong>这一步常被漏掉，导致明明能转个方向放下的商品被判为不适配。</strong></p>\n<p>用户约束的不确定性来自两处：用户给的是「大概 2.4 米」而非精确值；空间本身可能是梯形或以毫米计的非整。因此匹配不应用硬边界，而应引入安全余量：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>u</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>ε</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>ε</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>ε</mi><mtext>measure</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>ε</mi><mtext>tolerance</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_p \\le L_u - \\varepsilon, \\quad \\varepsilon = \\max(\\varepsilon_{\\text{measure}}, \\varepsilon_{\\text{tolerance}})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">measure</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">tolerance</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ε</mi><mtext>measure</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon_{\\text{measure}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">measure</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是用户的测量误差（默认 2<del>5cm），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ε</mi><mtext>tolerance</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon_{\\text{tolerance}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">tolerance</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是商品尺寸的工艺误差（木制家具通常 ±1</del>2cm，板材 ±0.5cm）。<strong>这个安全余量的存在意味着筛选结果应该分级</strong>：留有充足余量的标「完全合适」，接近边界的标「尺寸接近上限，建议核对」，超出但差距在容差内的也展示但明确提示。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    Q[用户查询/筛选] --&gt; SP[空间约束解析]&#10;    SP --&gt; D[三/二维区间]&#10;    SP --&gt; G[预留间隙规则库]&#10;    D --&gt; M[多朝向匹配 + 安全余量]&#10;    G --&gt; M&#10;    P[商品尺寸字段] --&gt; M&#10;    M --&gt; T{匹配等级}&#10;    T --&gt;|余量充足| A[完全合适]&#10;    T --&gt;|接近边界| B[建议核对]&#10;    T --&gt;|超差但在容差内| C[谨慎提示]&#10;    T --&gt;|明确超出| X[不展示]&#10;    A --&gt; R[排序: 尺寸接近理想值优先]&#10;    B --&gt; R&#10;    C --&gt; R\">graph TD\n    Q[用户查询/筛选] --&gt; SP[空间约束解析]\n    SP --&gt; D[三/二维区间]\n    SP --&gt; G[预留间隙规则库]\n    D --&gt; M[多朝向匹配 + 安全余量]\n    G --&gt; M\n    P[商品尺寸字段] --&gt; M\n    M --&gt; T{匹配等级}\n    T --&gt;|余量充足| A[完全合适]\n    T --&gt;|接近边界| B[建议核对]\n    T --&gt;|超差但在容差内| C[谨慎提示]\n    T --&gt;|明确超出| X[不展示]\n    A --&gt; R[排序: 尺寸接近理想值优先]\n    B --&gt; R\n    C --&gt; R</pre><p><strong>排序时「越接近理想值越好」还是「越宽松越好」取决于品类。</strong> 沙发这类有明确功能需求的商品，尺寸接近上限反而好（够大够舒适，在空间允许范围内尽量大）；而通道类家具（如玄关柜）接近上限会让人感到拥挤，宜留余量。这个偏好应由品类配置声明，属于 <a href=\"../category-search-diff/vertical-search-arch\">垂直搜索插件化架构</a> 中排序配置的一部分。</p>\n<h2 id=\"场景化筛选-从尺寸到-放得进我的房间\">场景化筛选：从尺寸到「放得进我的房间」</h2><p>纯数值筛选（宽度 100~150cm）对专业用户有效，但大多数用户不是这么思考的。他们想的是「放进我那个小客厅」「配我的原木风餐桌」。家居品类的一个重要机会是把尺寸筛选场景化。</p>\n<p><strong>房间预设是低成本的场景化手段。</strong> 提供「小户型客厅（面宽 &lt; 3m）」「主卧（面宽 3~4m）」「书房（进深 &lt; 2.5m）」等预设，每个预设对应一组尺寸区间与预留间隙规则。用户一次点击完成原本需要多次数值输入的筛选。预设的参数由家居品类的领域专家设定，是可维护的配置。</p>\n<p><strong>风格与尺寸的联合筛选是家居的特色需求。</strong> 用户很少单纯按尺寸找——「1.8 米宽的、原木风的、北欧简约的沙发」是真实查询。家居的款式属性（材质、风格、颜色、工艺）与尺寸属性必须能联合筛选，且筛选器的默认展开顺序应按品类配置（家居通常尺寸优先、风格次之；服饰颜色优先、尺码次之；3C 参数优先）。</p>\n<p><strong>套装与组合是场景化的最高形态。</strong> 用户搜「小户型餐桌椅套装」，需要的是成套的、尺寸互相匹配的组合，而不是单件。这需要跨 SPU 的组合关系建模，通常由商家在商品数据中声明（套装 SPU 包含哪些子件）。检索上应把套装作为一个整体单元返回，而不是拆成子件让用户自己组。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景化手段</th>\n<th>数据成本</th>\n<th>用户成本</th>\n<th>适用品类</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>数值区间筛选</td>\n<td>低（已有尺寸字段）</td>\n<td>高（需自己量并换算）</td>\n<td>全家居</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>房间预设</td>\n<td>中（需领域规则）</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>客厅、卧室、书房</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>风格+尺寸联合</td>\n<td>中（需风格属性抽取）</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>全家居</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>套装整体返回</td>\n<td>高（需套装关系）</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>餐桌椅、沙发套、床品</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"尺寸数据的质量与商业含义\">尺寸数据的质量与商业含义</h2><p>家居的尺寸数据质量问题比 3C 更严重，因为<strong>尺寸是不可标准化的</strong>——一张「1.8 米双人床」的实际外形尺寸因床架设计差异可以相差 10 厘米以上，而商家往往只标「1.8 米」（指床垫尺寸）而把外形尺寸写在详情页图片里。</p>\n<p>三条可行的改善路径：</p>\n<p><strong>路径一：强制字段与曝光激励。</strong> 把「外形三维 + 包装三维」设为参与尺寸类查询的准入条件。不填的商品仍可被非尺寸查询召回，但不能出现在尺寸筛选结果里。这个规则的效力取决于尺寸类查询在家居搜索中的占比——如果占 40% 以上，商家的填写意愿会显著提升。</p>\n<p><strong>路径二：从图片与文本抽取。</strong> 详情页的尺寸图（标注了尺寸的示意图）是高质量的尺寸来源，可以 OCR + 版面分析提取。文本中的「长 180cm 宽 90cm 高 75cm」这类表述也可抽取。两条路都需与 <a href=\"../fashion-apparel-search/size-color-style-attr\">尺码/颜色/款式/材质结构化</a> 中相同的置信度与降级机制配合。</p>\n<p><strong>路径三：用退货数据校正。</strong> 「尺寸不符」的退货原因结合用户输入的期望尺寸，可以反推商家标注的系统性偏差（如某品牌沙发标注深度总比实际少 5cm）。与 <a href=\"../fashion-apparel-search/size-fit-compatibility\">尺码兼容与合身推荐</a> 中的品牌偏移方法同源，只是这里偏的是物理尺寸而非尺码标签。</p>\n<p><strong>尺寸属性的商业含义远超检索本身。</strong> 尺寸数据完整度直接关联退货率、正相关于转化率、并且是「大件家具」这类高客单商品的决策核心。因此尺寸字段的建设不应被视为检索团队的单独任务，而应是品类运营与商家治理的联合目标。检索侧要做的是把这个价值显式化——例如在排序中给尺寸数据完整的商品一个小幅提升（属于 <a href=\"../category-search-diff/category-attribute-weight\">各品类关键属性与权重差异</a> 中的属性完整度信号），让商家看到填数据的回报。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>家居尺寸是多维的：外形三维、重量承重、通行（包装）尺寸、安装条件、预留间隙；通行尺寸是退货最被低估的原因，预留间隙是品类独有的领域知识资产。</li>\n<li>空间匹配是带朝向排列的多维区间包含问题，必须枚举三种有效排列并引入安全余量（测量误差 + 工艺误差），结果按余量分级展示而非二元判断。</li>\n<li>排序偏好（尺寸接近上限 vs 宜留余量）因品类而异，应作为品类配置声明。</li>\n<li>场景化筛选（房间预设、风格+尺寸联合、套装整体返回）是降低用户成本的关键，其中房间预设的领域规则可维护、收益最直接。</li>\n<li>尺寸数据质量靠三条路径改善：强制字段与曝光激励、图片/文本抽取、退货数据反推品牌级偏差。</li>\n<li>尺寸数据完整度是家居品类的核心商业指标，应与商家治理联动，并在排序中显式给予回报。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"家居尺寸/空间适配筛选","id":"家居尺寸-空间适配筛选"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：尺寸参数的多维性","id":"核心概念-尺寸参数的多维性"},{"level":2,"text":"空间适配的匹配模型","id":"空间适配的匹配模型"},{"level":2,"text":"场景化筛选：从尺寸到「放得进我的房间」","id":"场景化筛选-从尺寸到-放得进我的房间"},{"level":2,"text":"尺寸数据的质量与商业含义","id":"尺寸数据的质量与商业含义"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"型号兼容（配件适配设备）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/vertical-category-search/electronics-home-search/compatibility-model"},"next":{"title":"美妆肤质/色号/成分检索","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/vertical-category-search/beauty-fresh-other/beauty-skin-shade"}}